    "updated_at": "2021-07-15T22:41:41Z",
    "body": "It does not work because of this PR https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/2738.\r\nAll segments have empty string as value so the conditional format string is not rendered. \r\n\r\nContext: https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/e1fc137dc9b7fe4f992884b9984d8c1dba103370/src/formatter/string_formatter.rs#L314 in your case each value is `\"\"` so `is_empty()` returns `true` \r\n\r\nas a temporary solution I suggest to use this configuration\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nformat = \"([$all_status*$ahead_behind ](bold red))\"\r\nuntracked = \" \"\r\nmodified = \" \"\r\nstaged = \" \"\r\nrenamed = \" \"\r\ndeleted = \" \"\r\n```\r\n\r\nedit: `\"\\u0000\"` seems to work too \r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nformat = \"([$all_status*$ahead_behind ](bold red))\"\r\nuntracked = \"\\u0000\"\r\nmodified = \"\\u0000\"\r\nstaged = \"\\u0000\"\r\nrenamed = \"\\u0000\"\r\ndeleted = \"\\u0000\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n",
